(text "EN_IO33_QUAL = EN_IO33 AND PGR_AUX18 AND EN_AUX18.\nPG alone is insufficient: TPS62130 PG is high impedance while disabled.\nR6001 discharges IO3V3 even if the processor or PM firmware has stopped.\nAt C_IO <= 1 mF, 1k reduces 3.465 V to 2.625 V in < 0.28 s, plus relay delay.\nVerify the fitted bulk capacitance and ramp timing against AMD DS181 before board sign-off." (at 15.24 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1c1fd6c6-6a06-41c7-812f-c9f04c82f7cc"))
(embedded_fonts no)






